## Solution - Using java streams
```java[]
import java.util.stream.*;

class Solution {    
    public int[] singleNumber(int[] nums) {        
        return Arrays.stream(nums)
            .boxed()
            .collect(Collectors.groupingBy(o -> o, Collectors.counting()))
            .entrySet().stream()
            .filter(o -> o.getValue() < 2)
            .mapToInt(o -> o.getKey())
            .sorted()
            .toArray();
    }
}
